<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on May 15.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on May 15.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  May 15		 May 14</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.999		 16.838</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  24.658		 38.010</p>
<p>Cash balance		  29.657		 54.848</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,257.747	     5,253.726</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $47 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
